        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, mixed, 300kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, mixed, 300kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 300kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_300kW_v0.3_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: 4f59644e-3c7a-34b9-86ff-b516e730577e
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f59644e-3c7a-34b9-86ff-b516e730577e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
